## Promotion (if warranted)
- **Surfaced a well-posed optimization problem?** → spin a **campaign** (`new-campaign`), citing this session in `LINEAGE.md`.
- **Produced a reusable artifact** (a frozen model, a generated set)? → promote it to `../../shared/` (see project `CLAUDE.md`).
- **Established a verified fact about the system?** → only after `verify`-CONFIRMED, promote to project `DISCOVERIES.md`.
- Otherwise: leave it here, indexed in `LINEAGE.md` at its true tier.
